  "description": "The OXVA Xlim Pro 2 Vape Kit is the ultimate choice for vapers seeking a blend of style, convenience, and a suite of advanced yet intuitive features. Powered by an impressive 1300mAh built-in battery, this device supports a power output range of 5-30W, catering to both MTL (mouth-to-lung) and RDL (restricted direct-to-lung) vaping styles. The dazzling 0.56\" HD colour screen provides a crisp, colourful display for all vital information, and offers two themes and RGB lighting. With USB Type-C charging, capable of recharging up to 80% in 25 minutes, the Xlim Pro 2 ensures minimal downtime between sessions. This kit includes two 2ml top-fill Xlim pods with pre-installed mesh coils. The 0.6ohm pod is perfect for smooth and airy RDL vaping, while the 0.8ohm pod offers a tighter, more intensely flavoured MTL sensation. Both pods are designed for leak-proof performance and easy refilling. Constructed from durable zinc alloy, the Xlim Pro 2 is available in multiple stylish colours, with luxurious artificial leather options. The ergonomic design ensures a comfortable grip, making it a great choice for on-the-go, all-day vaping. We recommend paring this kit with the following e-liquids: OXVA Xlim Top Fill 0.6ohm RDTL - Use 50/50 or Nic Salt E-Liquids OXVA Xlim Top Fill 0.8ohm MTL - Use 50/50 or Nic Salt E-Liquids Check out our vape juice online and pair it perfectly with this kit. Please Note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil. How to set up the Oxva Xlim Pro 2 Pod Vape Kit",
